DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Indivisible Central Indiana! Interested in plugging
  into the local activist scene and getting more involved? Now's your chanc
 e! Join this Zoom meeting to: 1. Learn about the new leadership structure 
 of Indivisible Central Indiana 2. Find out what actions and events we'll b
 e hosting and promoting over the next few weeks 3. Identify which area of 
 interest is right for you 4. Get plugged in with the team you want to volu
 nteer with This meeting is for activists at all levels - from beginn
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/937406/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
